        "name": "preamp_ne5532",
        "description": "NE5532 dual low-noise op-amp configured as single-channel preamplifier. Uses one amplifier channel (IN1_P/IN1_N/OUT1) with IN2_P/IN2_N/OUT2 left uncommitted or available for second channel if needed. Provides voltage gain of approximately 10x-20x as first stage. Input coupling network and feedback network (resistor divider for gain setting) will be added downstream. Output AC-coupled to power amplifier input. VCC_P powered from VIN_9V, VCC_N to GND.",
