        "description": "LM386 low-voltage audio power amplifier as final output stage. Configured for gain of 20x (GAIN_1 and GAIN_2 left open/floating per datasheet default) or optionally 200x if gain pins bypassed with capacitor in downstream wiring. Receives preamplified signal at IN_POS, IN_NEG tied to GND for single-ended input. VOUT drives 8-ohm speaker through output coupling network. BYPASS pin needs external capacitor to GND for power supply decoupling/bypass. VS powered from VIN_9V, GND to system ground.",
